# Source and docs keep LF in the working tree on every platform, so a
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true does not rewrite them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Archived official responses are byte-exact captures and their manifests
# record size and SHA-256, so they must survive both checkout and commit
# untouched. Some are published with CRLF or mixed endings, which "text"
# normalization would strip. "-text" disables end-of-line conversion in
# both directions; "diff" keeps them reviewable as text.
tests/fixtures/** -text diff

*.png binary
*.webm binary
